{"id":"5ff9ef2df9bbb0b4","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-K-lower-cone-null.md","title":"每个初段K下锥具有零测度","display":"thm-K-lower-cone-null — 每个初段K下锥具有零测度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-K-lower-cone-null","aliases":["43-thm-K-lower-cone-null"],"display":"thm-K-lower-cone-null — 每个初段K下锥具有零测度","depends_on":["[[43-df-complexity-red]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 14.4.13; printed p.400 / PDF p.420","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-K-lower-cone-null"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-K-lower-cone-null</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-K-lower-cone-null — 每个初段K下锥具有零测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 14.4.13; printed p.400 / PDF p.420"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_K\">\\(\\le_K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 声明的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\bigl(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:X\\le_KA\\}\\bigr)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu\\bigl(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:X\\le_KA\\}\\bigr)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>源书把相对A随机的满测度类排除在该下锥外，借助K归约精化vL归约。结论适用于任意A，A不必随机或可计算；下锥基数可以同时为连续统。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 14.4.13; printed p.400 / PDF p.420。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 声明的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 声明的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\bigl(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:X\\le_KA\\}\\bigr)=0.","display":true}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-K-lower-cone-null]] — 每个初段K下锥具有零测度"}],"outgoing":["9d68ed64bfec741d","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}